    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Durak (Russian for &quot;Fool&quot;) is a classic card game of skill, chance and risk. Played with the 6-Ace cards from a standard deck of playing cards, 2-4 players take turns attacking and defending in this timeless game of social and psychological domination. Historically tied to gambling, Durak isn't just about winning - it's about what you're willing to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money, possessions... or something far more intimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of James, a cunning and charismatic loan shark, sitting across from your desperate debtor and his beautiful girlfriend Charlotte. The stakes couldn't be higher: their freedom - or her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hand raises the tension: win, and you edge closer to claiming Charlotte for yourself. Lose, and they pull away, but for how long? Watch as Charlotte's reactions change with every turn, caught between loyalty and your growing influence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffWin 5 games, and Charlotte becomes entirely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffLose 5, and they escape... if you let them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Charlotte doesn't suit your tastes or you're hungry for more, DLC girls with unique personalities, reactions, and secrets let you dive even deeper into this thrilling netorare experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you crave the power of being the bull, relishing every humiliating win, or love living through the torment of a cuck, this game will leave you wanting more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cIn this game of passion and humiliation, only the bold take it all.\u201d</strong></p>",
